# The wire-geometry cache. `WireGeometry.load` parses the wires JSON and writes this beside
# the module on first use, so it is build output, not source -- and it is 744 KB of it. The
# old repo ignored its copy for the same reason (`/data/*.npz`). Delete it to force a reparse.
wcfm/data/wire_geometry_*.npz
